  "description": "Bergamont Vitess bikes are fun and easy to ride. They feature an upright riding position for maximum comfort and control. The sloped frame has a medium step-over height to make getting on- and off the bike easier while retaining a sportive look.\n\nThe Vitess 40 model features a lightweight rigid aluminum fork and seat post to save weight. The Shimano drivetrain offers 2x8-speed shifting. Puncture resistant Schwalbe Energizer Active Plus tires and hydraulic disc brakes by Shimano cater to a safe and reliable ride.\n\nErgonomic contact points are key to match your bike to your optimal seating position. City and Trekking saddles in different widths, an adjustable stem and ergonomically shaped bars and lock-on grips ensure a perfect fit.\n\nVisibility is especially important if you cycle every day. Therefore, all Vitess models are equipped with LED front and rear lights. A standlight function and a hub dynamo are, of course, standard. Rounding off the package are multiple mounting points across the frame to securely fasten accessories like a bottle, tools or a lock.",
